body: "SYMPTOM: `pm linear sync --team ENG --dry-run` does NOT preview — it runs the write path. --limit was also ignored (always 100).\n\nROOT CAUSE: pm CLI normalizes loose extension flags to camelCase; code read ctx.options['dry-run']/['limit'] (kebab) -> always undefined -> dryRun=false. Proven: probe showed ctx.options['dry-run']=undefined, ['dryRun']=true.\n\nOBSERVED vs EXPECTED: observed silent writes during preview; expected no writes.\n\nFIX: added readStringOption/readNumberOption/readBooleanOption (check both kebab+camel); applied to team/state/limit/dry-run in command and importer. Verified: dry-run probe made 0 pm create calls, returned dryRun:true."
